cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Pedigree Tool"
abstract: >-
  Pedigree Tool is a desktop application for drawing pedigrees (family trees) for
  genetic counselling, teaching and research. Symbols follow the standard pedigree
  nomenclature (NSGC), layout is automatic, and drawings can be exported as fully
  editable PowerPoint slides. The application runs entirely on the local computer.
authors:
